// The bootstrap contract of the compiler sources in this folder.
// version: the bootstrap version a compiler built from these sources has.
//   Raise it when the compiler gains a language feature.
// minimum: the oldest bootstrap version that can compile these sources.
//   Raise it, to at most version, only once the sources use such a feature.
// bootstrap/ holds the seed that recovers the compiler from a clean checkout:
// it only has to load on the pinned runtime and compile these sources, and the
// compiler reaches its fixed point from there. Rewrite it with make
// bootstrap-artifact when minimum rises or the host's target changes; add a
// language feature first and use it in these sources only after the seed
// supports it. See docs/self-hosting-build.md.
version 7
minimum 6
